        <mxCell id="uSe" value="&lt;b&gt;Keychain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enrolled from the user application.&lt;br&gt;Stays at this site." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="user">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="190" width="452" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uSteps" value="&lt;b&gt;Install&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Install the user application on this PC.&lt;br&gt;2. Give it the owner key, the device trust anchor, and the SAE trust anchor.&lt;br&gt;3. Connect the keychain and enroll it from the application: owner, on-chip device key, PIN, and the signed device certificate. Adding a peer is optional.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The keychain stays on this PC. Its pads are filled at an SAE." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="user">
